<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>第七单元 学习任务群设计</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f6f8;
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "SimHei", sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .document-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 850px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 3px dashed #666;
            border-radius: 15px;
            position: relative;
            padding: 40px 20px 20px 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Decorative Bunting */
        .bunting {
            position: absolute;
            top: -5px;
            left: 10%;
            right: 10%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .flag {
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-left: 25px solid transparent;
            border-right: 25px solid transparent;
            border-top: 35px solid;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .f-blue { border-top-color: #599dda; }
        .f-red { border-top-color: #e25f54; }
        .f-yellow { border-top-color: #f2b92e; }
        .f-green { border-top-color: #7ab739; }
        .f-purple { border-top-color: #7d61b3; }

        /* Unit Tag */
        .unit-tag {
            position: absolute;
            top: 40px;
            left: -10px;
            background-color: #439646;
            color: #ffeb3b;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 8px 30px 8px 20px;
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 85% 0, 100% 50%, 85% 100%, 0 100%);
            transform: rotate(-8deg);
            z-index: 10;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 1px solid #2e6b30;
        }

        /* Main Header */
        .header-container {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 5;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .main-title-box {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #e05979;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 50px;
            border-radius: 20px 20px 20px 5px;
            box-shadow: 2px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .main-title-box h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        .main-title-box p {
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Central Pole */
        .center-pole {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            top: 40px;
            bottom: 30px;
            width: 8px;
            background-color: #e8d184;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            z-index: 2;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .center-pole::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -10px;
            left: -3px;
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            background-color: #e8d184;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        /* Columns Layout */
        .columns-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            padding: 0 10px;
        }
        .column {
            width: 47%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .right-column {
            margin-top: 60px; /* Stagger right column down */
        }

        /* Individual Items */
        .item {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .left-column .item { align-items: flex-end; }
        .right-column .item { align-items: flex-start; }

        /* Arrows */
        .arrow-title {
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 15px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            width: 75%;
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 4;
            position: relative;
        }
        .arrow-title.dark-text { color: #333; }
        .arrow-title.light-text { color: white; }

        .left-arrow {
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 95% 0, 100% 50%, 95% 100%, 0 100%);
            margin-right: -15px; /* Overlap pole */
        }
        .right-arrow {
            clip-path: polygon(5% 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 5% 100%, 0 50%);
            margin-left: -15px; /* Overlap pole */
        }

        /* Text Boxes */
        .text-box {
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #222;
            border: 1px dashed #d0d0d0;
            width: 90%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        /* Connecting Rings */
        .text-box::before, .text-box::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -22px;
            width: 5px;
            height: 25px;
            border: 2px solid #aaa;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background-color: #fff;
            z-index: 5;
        }
        .left-column .text-box::before { right: 25px; }
        .left-column .text-box::after { right: 75px; }

        .right-column .text-box::before { left: 25px; }
        .right-column .text-box::after { left: 75px; }

        /* Specific Colors */
        .c-blue { background-color: #599dda; }
        .bg-blue { background-color: #eef5fa; }

        .c-green1 { background-color: #65a65a; }
        .bg-green1 { background-color: #eff6ee; }

        .c-yellow { background-color: #f2b92e; }
        .bg-yellow { background-color: #fdf8ea; }

        .c-green2 { background-color: #7ab739; }
        .bg-green2 { background-color: #f1f7eb; }

        .c-purple1 { background-color: #7d61b3; }
        .bg-purple1 { background-color: #f2eefa; }

        .c-orange { background-color: #e25f54; }
        .bg-orange { background-color: #fdf0ef; }

        .c-purple2 { background-color: #a36bcc; }
        .bg-purple2 { background-color: #f6eff9; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="document-wrapper">

    <!-- Decorative Bunting -->
    <div class="bunting">
        <div class="flag f-blue"></div>
        <div class="flag f-red"></div>
        <div class="flag f-yellow"></div>
        <div class="flag f-blue"></div>
        <div class="flag f-green"></div>
        <div class="flag f-purple"></div>
        <div class="flag f-yellow"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Unit Tag -->
    <div class="unit-tag">第七单元</div>

    <!-- Center Pole -->
    <div class="center-pole"></div>

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header-container">
        <div class="main-title-box">
            <h1>学习任务群设计</h1>
            <p>学习动态描写和静态描写</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Grid -->
    <div class="columns-container">

        <!-- Left Column -->
        <div class="column left-column">

            <!-- Item 21 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title left-arrow c-blue light-text">21 古诗词三首</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-blue">
                    抓住古诗中静态描写和动态描写想象画面，如《山居秋暝》一诗中，静态描写：“明月松间照”。动态描写：“清泉石上流”“竹喧归浣女”“莲动下渔舟”。这首诗以动衬静，写出了山间傍晚的幽静。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 23 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title left-arrow c-green1 light-text">23 鸟的天堂</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-green1">
                    第一次去“鸟的天堂”，作者抓住大榕树的根、干、枝、叶等部位逐项来写，写出了大榕树的茂盛和充满活力，是静态描写。<br>
                    第二次去“鸟的天堂”，描写了鸟的活动场面，是动态描写，动静结合，让我们觉得大榕树真的是“鸟的天堂”。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 交流平台 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title left-arrow c-yellow dark-text">交流平台</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-yellow">
                    关注静态描写和动态描写的句子，品味并积累，强化单元语文要素。
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Right Column -->
        <div class="column right-column">

            <!-- Item 22 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title right-arrow c-green2 dark-text">22 四季之美</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-green2">
                    第1自然段描写春天黎明时分的天空，用“鱼肚色、红晕、红紫红紫”写出了天空颜色的变化，用“泛、染、飘”等动词和“一点儿一点儿、微微的”等叠词写出了天空颜色变化的过程。第2自然段描写夏夜萤火虫飞舞的迷人情景。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 24 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title right-arrow c-purple1 light-text">24 月迹</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-purple1">
                    抓住作者对月亮爬竹帘格儿的动态描写，以及对满院子玉玉的、银银的月光的静态描写，体会月亮动态时的顽皮可爱、静态时的恬静柔美。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 词句段运用 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title right-arrow c-orange light-text">词句段运用</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-orange">
                    第二题：读下面的例句，体会作者是如何把一个画面写具体的，仿照着写一写。
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 单元习作 -->
            <div class="item">
                <div class="arrow-title right-arrow c-purple2 light-text">单元习作</div>
                <div class="text-box bg-purple2">
                    __________即景<br>
                    习作内容：观察一种自然现象或一处自然景观，重点观察景物的变化，写下观察所得。根据自己的观察对象，把题目补充完整，如“雨中即景”“日落即景”“田野即景”“窗外即景”。
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
